1
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:39,000
The inbred hillbillies are back!

2
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:12,000
Wrong Turn 5: Bloodlines is a horror, thriller film directed by Declan O'Brien.

3
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:45,000
A small West Virginia town is hosting the legendary Mountain Man Festival on Halloween, where
throngs of costumed party goers gather for a wild night of music and mischief.

4
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:18,000
But an inbred family of hillbilly cannibals kill the fun when they trick and
treat themselves to a group of visiting college students.

5
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:51,000
Sheriff Angela, played by Camilla Arfwedson.

6
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:24,000
Maynard, played by Doug Bradley.

7
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:57,000
Linda, played by Borisa Tyutyundzhieva.

8
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:30,000
Lita, played by Roxanne McKee.

9
00:40:57,000 --> 00:41:03,000
Gus, played by Paul Luebke.

10
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:36,000
Ginny, played by Rosie Holden.

11
00:50:03,000 --> 00:50:09,000
Wrong Turn 5: Bloodlines (also known simply onscreen as Wrong Turn 5) is a
2012 slasher film written and directed by Declan O'Brien.

12
00:54:36,000 --> 00:54:42,000
The film stars Doug Bradley, Camilla Arfwedson, Simon Ginty, Roxanne
McKee, Paul Luebke, Oliver Hoare, and Kyle Redmond Jones.

13
00:59:09,000 --> 00:59:15,000
It is the fifth installment in the Wrong Turn film series, and is both a sequel to Wrong Turn 4:
Bloody Beginnings (2011), and the second part of the prequel to Wrong Turn (2003).

14
01:03:42,000 --> 01:03:48,000
The film follows a group of college students, on a trip to the Mountain Man Festival
on Halloween in West Virginia, who encounter a clan of cannibals.

15
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
Wrong Turn 5: Bloodlines was released on DVD and Blu-ray on October 23, 2012.

16
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
Upon release, the film received largely negative reviews from critics and fans and is often considered the
worst sequel in the series, with many criticizing its characters, plot, poor CGI, and acting.

17
01:17:21,000 --> 01:17:27,000
The film was followed by Wrong Turn 6: Last Resort (2014).

18
01:21:54,000 --> 01:22:00,000
The film explores themes of small town, mutant,
halloween, forest, west virginia.

19
01:26:27,000 --> 01:26:33,000
The tone is lighthearted and dark and intense.
